---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Fonts from '../components/Fonts.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import YearReveal from '../components/YearReveal.astro';
import SiteScripts from '../components/SiteScripts.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" page="long-distance.html">
<Fragment slot="head">
<meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Long-Distance Car Service from Miami | Onyx Executive Miami</title>
<meta name="description" content="Private long-distance chauffeur service from Miami: Key West and the Keys, Naples, Palm Beach, and Orlando. One vehicle, one chauffeur, door to door, fixed quote." />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0A0A0A" />
<Fonts />
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "serviceType": "Long-distance car service",
  "provider": {
    "@id": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/#business",
    "name": "Onyx Executive Miami",
    "url": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/"
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "South Florida"
  },
  "url": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/long-distance.html"
}
</script>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://onyxexecmiami.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Long-Distance"
    }
  ]
}
</script>
<script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {"@type": "Question","name": "Is the vehicle shared with other passengers?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer","text": "No — the vehicle is yours for the trip, one party at a time, not a shared shuttle."}},
    {"@type": "Question","name": "How many passengers and how much luggage fit?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer","text": "Up to six passengers; luggage capacity is confirmed at booking based on passenger count, bag count, and anything oversized like golf clubs or beach gear."}},
    {"@type": "Question","name": "Can I book one-way, or does it have to be round-trip?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer","text": "Either. One-way is quoted with the return positioning built into the fare; round-trip with a wait or a separate pickup time is quoted the same way, as a fixed price."}},
    {"@type": "Question","name": "What if I need the chauffeur to wait at the destination?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer","text": "Wait time — a few hours or a full day — is arranged at booking and priced into the quote, not billed as a surprise afterward."}},
    {"@type": "Question","name": "Do you handle overnight or multi-day trips?","acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer","text": "Yes — for multi-day itineraries, lodging and scheduling for the chauffeur are coordinated as part of the quote."}}
  ]
}
</script>
</Fragment>
<SiteHeader page="long-distance.html" />
<main id="main">

<section class="page-hero">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Long-Distance</p>
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">Long-Distance Transportation</p>
<h1 class="display">Door to door, beyond the city.</h1>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p class="lead">Private long-distance service from Miami to Key West and the Keys, Naples, Palm Beach, and Orlando — one vehicle, one chauffeur, the whole way. A fixed quote and a comfortable car beat a connection and a rental desk.</p>
<div class="page-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call now</a>
<a class="btn btn-light" href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20long-distance%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a>
</div>
<p class="trust-line">+1 786 931 ONYX (6699) · Licensed &amp; insured · Miami-Dade Permit #64666 · D-U-N-S&reg; 13-860-0693</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">The trip, not the transfers.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>For routes the airlines make awkward, a direct drive is often faster and far calmer: leave when you want, stop when you want, arrive at the door. Common runs include Miami to Key West, the Florida Keys, Naples and the Gulf coast, Palm Beach, and Orlando.</p>
<p>Each route is quoted as a fixed price including the return positioning, so the number you approve is the number you pay.</p>
</div>
<div class="figure reveal">
<div class="kicker">Keys<br>Naples<br><em>Orlando</em></div>
<p>Palm Beach, Fort Myers, and custom routes on request. One-way or round-trip, with wait time arranged for same-day returns.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft" style="padding-top:0">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="eyebrow">Popular Routes</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:24px">Four routes, quoted the same way.</h2>
<div class="cards reveal">
<a class="card" href="contact.html#book"><div class="no">01</div><h3>Miami → Key West</h3><p>Roughly 160 miles, 3.5-4 hours via the Overseas Highway. Stops for photos or lunch built into the plan on request.</p><div class="more">Get a quote →</div></a>
<a class="card" href="contact.html#book"><div class="no">02</div><h3>Miami → Naples</h3><p>Roughly 110 miles, 2-2.5 hours via Alligator Alley (I-75). A common day-trip pairing for Gulf coast plans.</p><div class="more">Get a quote →</div></a>
<a class="card" href="contact.html#book"><div class="no">03</div><h3>Miami → Orlando</h3><p>Roughly 235 miles, 3.5-4 hours via the Florida Turnpike. Theme park arrivals and departures timed to your schedule.</p><div class="more">Get a quote →</div></a>
<a class="card" href="contact.html#book"><div class="no">04</div><h3>Miami → Palm Beach</h3><p>Roughly 70 miles, 1.25-1.5 hours. Frequently booked alongside a same-day return or an overnight stay.</p><div class="more">Get a quote →</div></a>
</div>
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#7a7a7a;margin-top:16px">Distances and times are approximate and vary with traffic and exact addresses — confirmed at quote. Dedicated pages for each route are in progress.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-dark">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="grid-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:28px">
<p class="eyebrow on-dark">Before You Book</p>
<h2 class="h2">How long-distance pricing works.</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
</div>
<div class="faq reveal">
<details><summary>Is the vehicle shared with other passengers?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><div class="ans">No — the vehicle is yours for the trip, one party at a time, not a shared shuttle.</div></details>
<details><summary>How many passengers and how much luggage fit?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Up to six passengers; luggage capacity is confirmed at booking based on passenger count, bag count, and anything oversized like golf clubs or beach gear.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I book one-way, or does it have to be round-trip?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Either. One-way is quoted with the return positioning built into the fare; round-trip with a wait or a separate pickup time is quoted the same way, as a fixed price.</div></details>
<details><summary>What if I need the chauffeur to wait at the destination?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Wait time — a few hours or a full day — is arranged at booking and priced into the quote, not billed as a surprise afterward.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you handle overnight or multi-day trips?<span class="pm">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Yes — for multi-day itineraries, lodging and scheduling for the chauffeur are coordinated as part of the quote.</div></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft" style="padding-top:0">
<div class="wrap">
<p class="eyebrow">Related</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:30px">Often booked with</h2>
<div class="related reveal">
<a href="airport-transfers.html"><div class="rk">Airports</div><h3>Airport transfers</h3></a>
<a href="private-aviation.html"><div class="rk">FBO</div><h3>Private aviation</h3></a>
<a href="executive-chauffeur.html"><div class="rk">Hourly</div><h3>Executive chauffeur</h3></a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap">
<h2 class="h2">Where to?</h2>
<p>Tell us the destination and date — we'll quote a fixed price, door to door.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-light" href="tel:+17869316699">Call +1 786 931 ONYX (6699)</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html#book">Request a quote</a></div>
</div></section>
</main>
<SiteFooter />
<aside class="mbar"><a href="tel:+17869316699">Call</a><a href="https://wa.me/17869316699?text=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20long-distance%20quote." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a></aside>
<YearReveal />
<SiteScripts />
</Base>
